    {
      "key": "srd_sorcerer_spellcasting",
      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "description": "An event in your past, or in the life of a parent or ancestor, left an indelible mark on you, infusing you with arcane magic. Charisma is your spellcasting ability.\n\n**Spell save DC** = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Charisma modifier\n**Spell attack modifier** = your proficiency bonus + your Charisma modifier\n\nYou know a set number of sorcerer spells from the Sorcerer table's Spells Known column. Each learned spell must be of a level for which you have spell slots. You can replace one known spell when you gain a sorcerer level. You can use an arcane focus as a spellcasting focus for your sorcerer spells.",
      "gainedAtLevel": 1,
      "displayOrder": 1,
      "effects": [
